<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Merrill lowers Gillette.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Merrill lowers Gillette.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it lowered its near-term rating on Gillette Co to accumulate from buy.</p>
<p>-- Kept long-term buy rating on the stock.</p>
<p>-- The analyst was not immediately available for details.</p>
<p>-- The stock was not immediately open after closing Thursday at 78-1/2.</p>
</text>
